  "description": "2026 EVRYjourney Electric Rickshaw — Patent Pending Hitch Technology\n\nExperience the next evolution in electric mobility with the all-new 2026 EVRYjourney Electric Rickshaw, featuring a patent pending hitch system designed for comfort, safety, and versatility. Perfect for families, riders with mobility needs, or anyone seeking a smooth and accessible ride.\n\nThe new rear hitch makes it easy to expand your ride — attach an extra row of seats for family and friends or a spacious trailer basket for carrying groceries, mobility aids, or recreational gear. Both accessories are easy to install or remove, adding flexibility for every kind of outing, from daily errands to relaxing rides through the park. (Extra seat and trailer sold separately.)\n\nEnhanced hydraulic disc brakes on all three wheels—one front, two rear—ensure maximum stopping power and safety. The self-adjusting system keeps the pads at optimal distance for consistent braking, even with added passengers or cargo.\n\nKey Features:\n\nPowerful 750W motor for pedal-assist or full electric mode — ideal for reducing physical strain for riders with limited mobility.\n\nPatent pending hitch system allows secure attachment of extra seating or trailer for adaptive transport needs.\n\nHydraulic disc brakes for reliable, smooth stopping.\n\nDurable under-seat supports designed for a 300 lb bench seat capacity.\n\nFat tires (20” rear, 24” front) for a stable, cushioned ride on various terrains.\n\nMirrors included for enhanced visibility and safety.\n\nUL 2849 & UL 2271 compliant as tested by ACT Labs for proven electrical and battery safety.\n\nBuilt to combine independence, comfort, and capability, the EVRYjourney Electric Rickshaw redefines mobility—whether you’re transporting loved ones, carrying mobility equipment, or just enjoying the ride.",
